[Term]
id: PREFER:0000112
name: Residual compound amount
def: "The remaining amount of 'compound' left in the fermenter, expressed in g. It is calculated substracting the compound concentration measured offline, multiplied by the liquid_volume_downscaled to get the amount."
is_a: PREFER:0000017 ! Computed variable

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000113
