[Term]
id: PREFER:0000150
name: Data acquisition mode
def: "How where, and when process data or samples are collected and measured during a bioprocess. The modes included are inline, online, atline, and offline."

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000151
name: Inline measurement
def: "The analyzer is integrated into the bioreactor and the measurement is taken continuosly into the bioreactor. The sample flows continuously through the analyzer. The measurament is real-time with high frequency data, enabling real-time process monitoring and control."
is_a: PREFER:0000150 ! Data acquisition mode

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000152
name: Online measurement
def: "extract representative sample from the bioreactor and introduce it into the measurement zone. Sample can either be discarded or returned to the bioreactor."
is_a: PREFER:0000150 ! Data acquisition mode

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000153
name: Atline measurement
def: "extract a sample from the process line and transporte it to a nerby analyzer. There is delay between sampling and measurment."
is_a: PREFER:0000150 ! Data acquisition mode

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000154
name: Offline measurement
def: "Method that collects a sample from the process line and transports it to the analyzis laboratory. The sample is not returned to the process line"
is_a: PREFER:0000150 ! Data acquisition mode

[Term]
id: PREFER:0000155
name: Performance variable
def: "Variables evaluating process efficiency. Type of performance variable: yield, rate, respiratory metrics, and balance metrics."

